; Bare `color` resolves to two value-kinds — emit at the kvpair value's
; slot path.
; The aggregate phase names the manifest's own reference first: `:type color`
; in the plugin's manifest has two claimants in the composed catalog, so the
; preload walk reports it at [ambig-vk-a swatch hue] before any document.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code ambiguous_element_kind :path [ambig-vk-a swatch hue])
  (diagnostic :code ambiguous_element_kind :path [swatch hue]))
